{"id":"3402731b38b2c005","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-godel-rosser-equivalent.md","title":"Rosser Strengthens Gödel's Assumption","display":"prop-godel-rosser-equivalent — Rosser Strengthens Gödel's Assumption","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-godel-rosser-equivalent","aliases":["92-prop-godel-rosser-equivalent"],"display":"prop-godel-rosser-equivalent — Rosser Strengthens Gödel's Assumption","depends_on":["[[92-thm-first-incompleteness]]","[[92-thm-rosser-incompleteness]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-omega-consistency]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]","[[92-ex-rosser-sentence-construction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-godel-rosser-equivalent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-godel-rosser-equivalent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-godel-rosser-equivalent — Rosser Strengthens Gödel's Assumption"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02b34261c2cb199c\" href=\"?note=02b34261c2cb199c\" title=\"92-thm-first-incompleteness\">92-thm-first-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e56db0129607b23\" href=\"?note=6e56db0129607b23\" title=\"92-thm-rosser-incompleteness\">92-thm-rosser-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b15ebe94f199828c\" href=\"?note=b15ebe94f199828c\" title=\"92-df-omega-consistency\">92-df-omega-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"dc82a379ef71435e\" href=\"?note=dc82a379ef71435e\" title=\"92-ex-rosser-sentence-construction\">92-ex-rosser-sentence-construction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (external consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (omega-consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b15ebe94f199828c\" href=\"?note=b15ebe94f199828c\" title=\"92-df-omega-consistency\">92-df-omega-consistency</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inc}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Inc}(G)\\)</span> (syntactic incompleteness predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (shared effectivity and arithmetic-strength conditions)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}godel\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Inc}(G)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(G\\nvdash\\varphi\\land G\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\n(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Inc}(G))\n\\land(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\n\\bigl((\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Inc}(G))\n\\Longrightarrow\n(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Inc}(G))\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}godel\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Inc}(G)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(G\\nvdash\\varphi\\land G\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\n(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Inc}(G))\n\\land(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\n\\bigl((\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Inc}(G))\n\\Longrightarrow\n(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Inc}(G))\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gödel与Rosser定理给出相同类型的结论，但前提强度不同；文件名沿用旧标签，修复后的断言不再把二者称为逻辑等价</li>\n<li>Gödel：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性 → 不可判定句子存在</li>\n<li>Rosser：一致性 → 不可判定句子存在</li>\n<li>因为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span>，Rosser的较弱一致性假设覆盖Gödel的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性情形</li>\n<li>但两者都证明了不完备性的存在</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-thm-first-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"02b34261c2cb199c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-first-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-rosser-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"6e56db0129607b23","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-rosser-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"b15ebe94f199828c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-omega-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-elementary-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiom-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ex-rosser-sentence-construction","status":"resolved","id":"dc82a379ef71435e","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ex-rosser-sentence-construction]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (external consistency predicate, see [[92-df-consistent]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"b15ebe94f199828c","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (omega-consistency predicate, see [[92-df-omega-consistency]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inc}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}godel\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Inc}(G)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(G\\nvdash\\varphi\\land G\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)&\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\n(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Inc}(G))\n\\land(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G))\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\land\n\\bigl((\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Inc}(G))\n\\Longrightarrow\n(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Inc}(G))\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":2052,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["02b34261c2cb199c","6e56db0129607b23","c7befd96bd551ade","b15ebe94f199828c","90f32e29c9d553ed","360e00ddf38f0f16","468d35690d25ee42","35c764f4e9f21f28","dc82a379ef71435e"]}